## Bab 10 — Glossarium & Rumus

| Istilah | Definisi |
|---------|----------|
| **APQC PCF** | American Productivity & Quality Center — Process Classification Framework. Standar internasional untuk taksonomi proses bisnis. |
| **L1 / L2 / L3** | Level hirarki proses: L1 = Category, L2 = Process Group, L3 = Activity (unit terkecil yang dikelola). |
| **RACI** | Responsible, Accountable, Consulted, Informed — matriks penugasan tanggung jawab proses. |
| **ACI** | Accountability Concentration Index — persentase proses L3 yang terkonsentrasi di satu subdit. |
| **Hay Method** | Metode evaluasi jabatan dari Hay Group yang menilai Know-How, Problem Solving, dan Accountability. |
| **Job Size Index** | Skor akhir evaluasi jabatan: KH^α × PS_eff^β × AC^γ |
| **Know-How (KH)** | Modal pengetahuan: AVG(Domain Count + Reg. Intensity + Specialization) per L3 |
| **Problem Solving (PS)** | Transformasi kognitif: AVG(Complexity) × AVG(Interdependency) × √n |
| **Accountability (AC)** | Eksposur risiko: AVG(FtA × Strategic × Risk × SysExp) × log₂(n+1) |
| **Systemic Exposure** | 4 dimensi tambahan: Freedom to Act, Reg. Exposure, Rep. Risk, ESG Impact |
| **Load Index** | Indeks beban kerja relatif: Σ(Structural Weight × Volume Category) per subdit |
| **Load Hours** | Estimasi jam kerja absolut: Σ(Standard Time × Volume/Month) per subdit |
| **Gini Coefficient** | Ukuran ketimpangan distribusi (0 = sempurna merata, 1 = timpang total) |
| **Severity** | Risk Severity Index: Probability × Impact × 100 |
| **Probability** | (Load Index / Max Load) × 100% — seberapa besar tekanan kerja |
| **Impact** | (Job Size / Max Job Size) × 100% — seberapa besar dampak jika gagal |
| **CV** | Coefficient of Variation — rasio standar deviasi terhadap rata-rata |
| **r²** | Coefficient of Determination — korelasi kuadrat, seberapa besar variabel X menjelaskan variabel Y |

